  "worked_solution": "To subtract $-37$ from $40,$ we combine the two negative signs to make a single plus sign. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}40-(-37) & = \\\\ 40+37 & = \\\\ 77 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
